{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ContentSearchService","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It supports cross-element matching within the same resource via a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"sliding window","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" over the resource’s concatenated element texts. The window","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"maintains a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"danger zone","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" (last ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"T"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" characters) where matches are deferred","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the next iteration, enabling queries that span element boundaries (e.g.,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"<p>The quick<\/p><p>brown fox.<\/p>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" matches “quick brown”).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Cross-resource matching is intentionally not supported (the window is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"flushed at every resource boundary).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Regex limitation:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" for variable-length or greedy patterns the danger-zone","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"heuristic (last 256 chars) is an approximation. A greedy pattern that starts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"before the danger zone but could extend further into the next element may be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"emitted prematurely, with a shorter-than-optimal match. Plain-text queries","type":"text"},{"tex